OL,3,GNEWSAPetition to stop fines for school
OL,4,Aabsence handed in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition with more than 290,000
OL,7,Fsignatures has been handed into Downing
OL,8,FStreet calling for families of children
OL,9,Fwith suspected special education needs
OL,10,Fand disabilities (SEND) not to be fined
OL,11,Fand prosecuted when pupils do not
OL,12,Fattend school.
OL,14,FThe campaign was started in 2022 by
OL,15,FSusan Liverman, from Corby,
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire, and Maddie Roberts,
OL,17,Ffrom Sandy, Bedfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
