OL,3,GNEWSAPetition to stop fines for school
OL,4,Aabsence handed in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe No School Fines group has the
OL,7,Fsupport of Anna Maxwell Martin, the
OL,8,FMotherland and Ludwig actor, who said
OL,9,Fthe current system was "cruel and
OL,10,Funnecessary".
OL,12,FA Department for Education spokesperson
OL,13,Fsaid it was "taking action to transform
OL,14,Fthe system".
